//
// A lager with a multistep fermentation ending in a cold crash below 0°C, so that a negative Celsius temperature is
// exercised.  Also:
//  • A step mash with a decoction
//  • A 90-minute boil with inline (counterflow) chilling
//  • Mostly-RO water, adjusted with calcium chloride and lactic acid (ie a water agent with a percent acid)
//  • A fining (gelatin) added during a specific fermentation step
//  • A brew log containing only the required fields
//
